{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_183_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_183","textTraditional":"一、三年。春王正月丁未，滕子泉卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_183_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_183","textTraditional":"二、夏，叔弓如滕。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_183_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_183","textTraditional":"三、五月，葬滕成公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_183_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_183","textTraditional":"四、秋，小邾婁子來朝。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_183_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_183","textTraditional":"五、八月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_183_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_183","textTraditional":"六、冬，大雨雹。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_183_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_183","textTraditional":"七、北燕伯款出奔齊。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}